 "text": "About\nContact us\nSurvey\n800 124 0166\nLogin\nالعربية\nFinancing Solutions\nBusiness Solutions\nFinancing Products Prices\nRegister your Interest\nRegister your Interest\nThe REDF’s and MOH Sponsorship Housing Support Program Covers Your Home Finance with Dar Al Tamleek\n\nYou can now benefit from the support of the Real Estate Development Fund and the Ministry of Housing through the Murabaha-based home finance program, with support applied for eligible customers under the program.\n\nHousing Support Program for Purchasing a Ready Unit\nDown Payment Reduction Service – as low as 5% for First Homebuyers\nFind out More\nFinancing Solutions\n\nA variety of home financing solutions tailored to match your specific needs and budget. Please select what represents you from the below:\n\nHome Finance Murabaha\nREDF Beneficiaries\nCookies Information\nThis website uses cookies to enhance site navigation, analyze site usage and assist in marketing efforts. Check our Cookie Policy for details.\nAccept\nDecline\n call us 800 124 0166\nFinancing Solutions\nRegister your Interest Calculator Locations\nBusiness Solutions\nManagement Services Realtors Real Estate Developer Employer Program (Corporate)\nWho we are\nBoard of Directors Shariah Compliance Investors Relations Media coverage Careers\nSIBOR\n4.9597\n\n28/07/2026\n\n© Copyright 2026 Dar Al Tamleek. All Rights Reserved.\nTerms & Conditions | Privacy Policy",
